# LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says: Prettier, the snapshot and the byte-exact DBML
# round-trip tests expect LF on Windows too. Git tells binary files apart by itself; the types
# below are named so it never has to guess.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.tgz binary
